        {
          "result": {
            "endpoints": [
              {
                "method": "POST",
                "path": "/admin/video-generations",
                "source": "custom",
                "summary": "Freeze one SKU's video request into a drafting job. The draft carries the backend's estimate (amount, currency, price source) or null when unknown. Creating a draft is free; nothing is generated or charged until an approval with a cost cap."
